3. Petitioner in this writ petition prays for the following relief:-
"Under these circumstances, the petitioner prays that Your Lordship would be pleased to pass appropriate direction to L.A. Authority to deposit the compensation amount in Nationalised Bank with compound interest as applicable to Bank with further direction to the Opposite party No.3 to proceed with L.A. Case No. 43/8 of 2013;
And pass any other order/orders, direction/ directions as this Hon'ble Court deems just, fit, equitable and proper in the facts and circumstances of the present case in order to give complete reliefs;
Rabindra Das vs The Union Of India on 2 September, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/102100896/
1 And for this act of kindness, the petitioner as in duty bound shall ever pray."
